# The old-site Vercel project (makor-morning-news) serves the self-contained
# index.html plus a handful of small serverless functions under api/ (One-Pager
# PPTX merging via python-pptx, the mentor email send via Brevo) — the only
# backend code this project has. Everything else in this folder (the webapp/
# refonte, docs, graphify output, worktrees, scratch notes) must NOT be
# uploaded to it. Deploying the webapp/ project is done from inside webapp/,
# so this file does not affect it.
*
!index.html
!api
!api/**
